For dispatch dispatch-1 (fix), first run kander move 20260101-golden-task working --dispatch-id dispatch-1 --execution-epoch 2. Execute work only when its JSON says replayed=false. If replayed=true or the command fails, do not repeat work; report the durable receipt. Use --dispatch-id dispatch-1 --execution-epoch 2 and the current --expect-revision on every update. Complete via move review (fix/sync) or move done --result completed (wrap-up), carrying the same dispatch ID/epoch plus --delivery-commit <final full SHA> and, when applicable, --disposition <card-relative artifact>. Terminal marker echo is transport diagnostics only, never acceptance.

Before running any `kander` command in this session, read `/rules/snippets/commands/README.md` once. Before the first use of a command, read its contract file.
